      },
      "questionNumber": "01",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$A=[\\begin{matrix}2 & 3 & 1\\\\ 1 & 2 & 2\\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{matrix}],B={A}^{t},f(x)={x}^{2}-4x$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$g(x)=\\frac{1}{2x-3}$ ফাংশনটির রেঞ্জ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "ধরি, $y=g(x)=\\frac{1}{2x-3}$\nবা, $2xy-3y=1$\nবা, $2xy=1+3y$\n$∴x=\\frac{1+3y}{2y}∈\\overset{―}{N}$ হবে যদি ও কেবল যদি $y\\neq0$ হয়।\n$∴g(x)$ ফাংশনটির রেঞ্জ = $\\overset{―}{N}-\\{0\\}$ (Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$f(\\text{ }B)$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $f(x)={x}^{2}-4x$\n$∴f(\\text{ }B)={B}^{2}-4\\text{ }B$\n$∴B={A}^{t}=[\\begin{matrix}2 & 3 & 1\\\\ 1 & 2 & 2\\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}2 & 1 & 1\\\\ 3 & 2 & 2\\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴{B}^{2}=[\\begin{matrix}2 & 1 & 1\\\\ 3 & 2 & 2\\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{matrix}][\\begin{matrix}2 & 1 & 1\\\\ 3 & 2 & 2\\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{matrix}]$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}4+3+1 & 2+2+2 & 2+2+0\\\\ 6+6+2 & 3+4+4 & 3+4+0\\\\ 2+6+0 & 1+4+0 & 1+4+0\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}8 & 6 & 4\\\\ 14 & 11 & 7\\\\ 8 & 5 & 5\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴f(\\text{ }B)={B}^{2}-4\\text{ }B=[\\begin{matrix}8 & 6 & 4\\\\ 14 & 11 & 7\\\\ 8 & 5 & 5\\end{matrix}]-[\\begin{matrix}8 & 4 & 4\\\\ 12 & 8 & 8\\\\ 4 & 8 & 0\\end{matrix}]$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}0 & 2 & 0\\\\ 2 & 3 & -1\\\\ 4 & -3 & 5\\end{matrix}]\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$B$ এর বিপরীত ম্যাট্রিক্স নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$|B|=|\\begin{matrix}2 & 1 & 1\\\\ 3 & 2 & 2\\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{matrix}|$ [‘খ' হতে প্রাপ্ত] \n$=2(0-4)-1(0-2)+1(6-2)$\n$=-8+2+4=-2\\neq0$\n$∴{B}^{-1}$ নির্ণয়যোগ্য।\n$\\begin{matrix} & {B}_{11}=(-1{)}^{1+1}|\\begin{matrix}2 & 2\\\\ 2 & 0\\end{matrix}|=0-4=-4\\\\ & {\\text{ }B}_{12}=(-1{)}^{1+2}|\\begin{matrix}3 & 2\\\\ 1 & 0\\end{matrix}|=-(0-2)=2\\\\ & {\\text{ }B}_{13}=(-1{)}^{1+3}|\\begin{matrix}3 & 2\\\\ 1 & 2\\end{matrix}|=6-2=4\\\\ & {\\text{ }B}_{21}=(-1{)}^{2+1}|\\begin{matrix}1 & 1\\\\ 2 & 0\\end{matrix}|=-(0-2)=2\\\\ & {\\text{ }B}_{22}=(-1{)}^{2+2}|\\begin{matrix}2 & 1\\\\ 1 & 0\\end{matrix}|=0-1=-1\\\\ & {\\text{ }B}_{23}=(-1{)}^{2+3}|\\begin{matrix}2 & 1\\\\ 1 & 2\\end{matrix}|=-(4-1)=-3\\\\ & {\\text{ }B}_{31}=(-1{)}^{3+1}|\\begin{matrix}1 & 1\\\\ 2 & 2\\end{matrix}|=2-2=0\\\\ & {\\text{ }B}_{32}=(-1{)}^{3+2}|\\begin{matrix}2 & 1\\\\ 3 & 2\\end{matrix}|=-(4-3)=-1\\\\ & {\\text{ }B}_{33}=(-1{)}^{3+3}|\\begin{matrix}2 & 1\\\\ 3 & 2\\end{matrix}|=4-3=1\\end{matrix}$\n$\\begin{matrix} & ∴{B}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{|\\text{ }B|}adjB=\\frac{1}{-2}{[\\begin{matrix}-4 & 2 & 4\\\\ 2 & -1 & -3\\\\ 0 & -1 & 1\\end{matrix}]}^{t}\\\\ & =\\frac{-1}{2}[\\begin{matrix}-4 & 2 & 0\\\\ 2 & -1 & -1\\\\ 4 & -3 & 1\\end{matrix}]\\text{ (Ans.) }\\end{matrix}$"
          }
        }
      ],
