      "questionNumber": "06",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "দৃশ্যকল্গ: ABC ত্রিভুজের পরিসীমা 2s।",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\frac{\\cos{75}^{\\circ}+\\cos{15}^{\\circ}}{\\cos{75}^{\\circ}-\\cos{15}^{\\circ}}$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\begin{matrix} & \\frac{\\cos{75}^{\\circ}+\\cos{15}^{\\circ}}{\\cos{75}^{\\circ}-\\cos{15}^{\\circ}}\\\\ & =\\frac{2\\cos\\frac{{75}^{\\circ}+{15}^{\\circ}}{2}\\cos\\frac{{75}^{\\circ}-{15}^{\\circ}}{2}}{2\\sin\\frac{{75}^{\\circ}+{15}^{\\circ}}{2}\\sin\\frac{{15}^{\\circ}-{75}^{\\circ}}{2}}\\\\ & =\\frac{\\cos{45}^{\\circ}\\cos{30}^{\\circ}}{\\sin{45}^{\\circ}\\sin(-{30}^{\\circ})}=\\cot{45}^{\\circ}(-\\cot{30}^{\\circ})\\\\ & =1\\times(-\\sqrt{3})=-\\sqrt{3}\\text{ (Ans.) }\\\\ & \\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$secB=\\secC\\secA$ হলে দেখাও যে, $\\tanA=2\\cotC$ ."
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, secB = secC secA\nবা, $\\frac{1}{\\cosB}=\\frac{1}{\\cosC}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\cosA}$\n$∴\\cosB=\\cosA\\cosC$\nআমরা জানি, $A+B+C=\\pi$\nবা, $B=\\pi-(A+C)$\nবা, $\\cosB=\\cos\\{\\pi-(A+C)\\}$\nবা, $\\cosB=-\\cos(A+C)$\nবা, $\\cosA\\cosC=-(\\cosA\\cosC-\\sinA\\sinC)$\nবা, $2\\cosA\\cosC=\\sinA\\sinC$\nবা, $\\frac{2\\cosC}{\\sinC}=\\frac{\\sinA}{\\cosA}$\n$∴\\tanA=2\\cotC$ (দেখানো হলো)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্পের আলোকে $4\\text{ }s(\\text{ }s-b)=3ca$ হলে, $∠B$ এর মান কত?"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $4\\text{ }s(\\text{ }s-b)=3ca$\nবা, $\\frac{s(s-b)}{ca}=\\frac{3}{4}$\nবা, ${\\cos}^{2}\\frac{B}{2}=\\frac{3}{4}$\nবা, $\\cos\\frac{B}{2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}=\\cos{30}^{\\circ}$\nবা, $\\frac{B}{2}={30}^{\\circ}$\n$∴B={60}^{\\circ}$ (Ans.)"
          }
        }
      ],
