    {
      "clientId": "chittagong-2017-math1st-cq07",
      "curriculum": {
        "path": "hsc/math/1st/chapter-9"
      },
      "questionNumber": "07",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "দৃশ্যকল্প: $g(x)=x{cosec}^{-1}\\frac{1}{x},y=\\cos(m{\\sin}^{-1}p)$ ।",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$x$ এর সাপেক্ষে $\\ln(x+\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{a}^{2}})$ এর অন্তরজ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "ধরি, $y=\\ln\\{x+\\sqrt{}({x}^{2}+{a}^{2})\\}$\n$\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{\\frac{d}{dx}\\{x+\\sqrt{}({x}^{2}+{a}^{2})\\}}{x+\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+{a}^{2})}}$\n$=\\frac{1+\\frac{2x}{2\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+{a}^{2})}}}{x+\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+{a}^{2})}}$\n$=\\frac{\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+{a}^{2})+x}}{\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+{a}^{2})}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{x+\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+{a}^{2})}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{a}^{2}}}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্পের আলোকে $x$ এর সাপেক্ষে $g(x)$ এর যোগজ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $g(x)=x{cosec}^{-1}\\frac{1}{x}$\n$∴g(x)=x{\\sin}^{-1}x$\n$∴\\intx{\\sin}^{-1}xdx={\\sin}^{-1}x\\intxdx-\\int\\{\\frac{d}{dx}({\\sin}^{-1}x)\\intxdx\\}dx$\n$=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\int\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\cdot\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}dx$\n$=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{1-(1-{x}^{2})}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}dx$\n$=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}+\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}dx$\n$=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x+\\frac{1}{2}[\\frac{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x]+c$\n[যেখানে, c সমাকলন ধ্রুবক]\n$=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{4}{\\sin}^{-1}x+\\frac{x}{4}\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}+c$\nনির্ণেয় যোজিত ফল $=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{4}{\\sin}^{-1}x+\\frac{x}{4}\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}+c$ ."
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্পের আলোকে প্রমাণ কর যে, $(1-{p}^{2}){y}_{2}-p{y}_{1}+{m}^{2}y=0$ ."
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $y=\\cos(m{\\sin}^{-1}p)$\nx এর সাপেক্ষে অন্তরীকরণ করে পাই,\n${y}_{1}=\\frac{d}{dx}\\{\\cos(m{\\sin}^{-1}p)\\}$\nবা, ${y}_{1}=-\\sin(m{\\sin}^{-1}p)\\cdot\\frac{m}{\\sqrt{1-{p}^{2}}}$\nবা, ${y}_{1}\\sqrt{1-{p}^{2}}=-m\\sin(m{\\sin}^{-1}p)$\nবা, ${y}_{1}^{2}(1-{p}^{2})={m}^{2}{\\sin}^{2}(m{\\sin}^{-1}p)$\nবা, ${y}_{1}^{2}(1-{p}^{2})={m}^{2}\\{1-{\\cos}^{2}(m{\\sin}^{-1}p)\\}$\nবা, ${y}_{1}^{2}(1-{p}^{2})={m}^{2}(1-{y}^{2})$\nবা, $(1-{p}^{2})2{y}_{1}\\cdot{y}_{2}-2p{y}_{1}^{2}=-2{m}^{2}y\\cdot{y}_{1}$\n$∴ (1-{p}^{2}){y}_{2}-p{y}_{1}+{m}^{2}y=0$ . (প্রমাণিত)"
          }
        }
      ],
