    {
      "clientId": "chittagong-2017-math1st-cq08",
      "curriculum": {
        "path": "hsc/math/1st/chapter-9"
      },
      "questionNumber": "08",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "দৃশ্যকল্প: $f(p)={e}^{-2p}$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}(1+3x{)}^{\\frac{x}{x}}$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "ধরি, $y=\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}(1+3x{)}^{\\frac{5}{x}}$\n$∴\\lny=\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{5}{x}\\ln(1+3x)$\n$=\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{5}{x}\\{3x-\\frac{(3x{)}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{(3x{)}^{3}}{3}-….\\}$\n$=\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}(15-\\frac{45x}{2}+45{x}^{2}-…….)$\nবা, $\\lny=15$ বা, $y={e}^{15}$\n$∴\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}(1+3x{)}^{\\frac{5}{x}}={e}^{15}\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্পের আলোকে p এর সাপেক্ষে মূল নিয়মে $f(p)$ এর অন্তরজ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $f(p)={e}^{-2p}$\n$∴f(p+h)={e}^{-2(p+h)}={e}^{-2p-2\\text{ }h}$\nসংজ্ঞানুসারে, $\\frac{d}{dp}\\{f(p)\\}=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{f(p+h)-f(p)}{h}$\n$∴\\frac{d}{dp}({e}^{-2p})=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{{e}^{-2p-2\\text{ }h}-{e}^{-2p}}{h}$\n$=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{{e}^{-2p}({e}^{-h}-1)}{h}$\n$=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}\\frac{{e}^{-2p}}{h}(1-\\frac{2\\text{ }h}{1!}+\\frac{(-2\\text{ }h{)}^{2}}{2!}+……-1)$\n$=\\underset{h\\to0}{lim}{e}^{-2p}(-2+2\\text{ }h+h$ এর উচ্চ ঘাতবিশিষ্ট পদসমূহ)\n$=-2{e}^{-2p}\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$4f(p)+\\frac{9}{f(p)}$ এর চরম মান নির্ণয় কর ।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "ধরি, $y=4f(p)+\\frac{9}{f(p)}$\n$=4{e}^{-2p}+\\frac{9}{{e}^{-2p}}=4{e}^{-2p}+9{e}^{2p}$\n$∴\\frac{dy}{dp}=4(-2){e}^{-2p}+9.2{e}^{2p}=-8{e}^{-2p}+18{e}^{2p}$\n$∴\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{d{p}^{2}}=-8(-2{e}^{-2p})+18(2{e}^{2p})=16{e}^{-2p}+36{e}^{2p}$\nচরম মানের জন্য, $\\frac{dy}{dp}=0$\nবা, $-8{e}^{-2p}+18{e}^{2p}=0$ বা, $18{e}^{2p}=8{e}^{-2p}$\nবা, ${e}^{4p}=\\frac{8}{18}=\\frac{4}{9}$ বা, $4p=\\ln\\frac{4}{9}∴p=\\frac{1}{4}\\ln\\frac{4}{9}$\n$p=\\frac{1}{4}\\ln\\frac{4}{9}$ হলে,\n$\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{{dp}^{2}}=16{e}^{-2\\times\\frac{1}{4}\\ln\\frac{4}{9}}+36{e}^{2\\times\\frac{1}{4}\\ln\\frac{4}{9}}$\n$=16{e}^{\\ln{(\\frac{4}{9})}^{\\frac{-1}{2}}}+36{e}^{\\ln(\\frac{4}{9})\\frac{1}{2}}$\n$=16\\times\\frac{3}{2}+36\\times\\frac{2}{3}=24+24=48>0$\n$∴p=\\frac{1}{4}\\ln\\frac{4}{9}$ এর জন্য প্রদত্ত ফাংশনটির সর্বনিম্ন মান বিদ্যমান।\n$∴$ সর্বনিম্ন মান $=4{e}^{-2\\times\\frac{1}{4}\\ln\\frac{4}{9}+9{e}^{2\\times\\frac{1}{4}}\\ln\\frac{4}{9}}$\n$=4{e}^{\\ln(\\frac{4}{9})\\frac{-1}{2}}+9{e}^{\\ln(\\frac{4}{9})\\frac{1}{2}}$\n$=4\\times\\frac{3}{2}+9\\times\\frac{2}{3}$\n= 6+6 \n=12 (Ans.)"
          }
